#. translators: Heading of the notice shown on the WordPress dashboard and plugins screen after WPML stopped adding hreflang tags to the page head. "Hreflang" is an HTML attribute name and stays in English.
#: classes/Shared/HeadLangsNoticeHooks.php:79
msgid "Hreflang tags moved to your sitemap"
msgstr "Tagi hreflang zostały przeniesione do mapy strony"

#. translators: Text of the "Hreflang tags moved to your sitemap" notice. "<head>" is the name of an HTML section and must stay exactly as it is.
#: classes/Shared/HeadLangsNoticeHooks.php:80
msgid "To improve SEO and avoid duplicate hreflang data, WPML now adds hreflang tags only to your sitemap. We have disabled the hreflang tags in your page's <head> section."
msgstr "Aby poprawić SEO i uniknąć duplikowania danych hreflang, WPML dodaje teraz tagi hreflang tylko do mapy strony. Wyłączyliśmy tagi hreflang w sekcji <head> Twojej strony."

#. translators: Last line of the "Hreflang tags moved to your sitemap" notice. %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag. The words between them are a path through the WordPress admin and should read as those screens are named in this language. "<head>" is the name of an HTML section and stays as it is.
#: classes/Shared/HeadLangsNoticeHooks.php:84
#, php-format
msgid "If you prefer to keep them in the <head>, you can re-enable this option in %1$sWPML → Settings → URLs and SEO%2$s."
msgstr "Jeśli wolisz zachować je w sekcji <head>, możesz ponownie włączyć tę opcję w %1$sWPML → Ustawienia → Adresy URL i SEO%2$s."

#. translators: Heading of the box on the Yoast SEO settings screen that lists one sitemap per language. A noun phrase, not an instruction.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Sitemap/PerLanguageSitemapsNotice.php:167
msgid "Sitemaps for each language"
msgstr "Mapy stron dla każdego języka"

#. translators: Text inside the "Sitemaps for each language" box on the Yoast SEO settings screen, above the list of addresses. "Google Search Console" is a product name and stays in English.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Sitemap/PerLanguageSitemapsNotice.php:171
msgid "Each language runs on its own domain, so each one has its own sitemap. Submit all of them to Google Search Console."
msgstr "Każdy język działa we własnej domenie, więc każdy z nich ma własną mapę strony. Prześlij je wszystkie do Google Search Console."

#. translators: Label shown on a Yoast SEO field on the term editing screen when WPML supplies the translation and the field is read-only.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Terms/Meta/AdminScreenHooks.php:149
msgid "Translated by WPML"
msgstr "Przetłumaczone przez WPML"

#. translators: Explanation under that label. "Edit anyway" is the button below it, so translate the two the same way. "WPML String Translation" is a product name and stays in English.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Terms/Meta/AdminScreenHooks.php:150
msgid "This field shows the translation that WPML String Translation serves. Click \"Edit anyway\" to override it."
msgstr "To pole pokazuje tłumaczenie, które obsługuje WPML String Translation. Kliknij „Edytuj mimo to”, aby je nadpisać."

#. translators: Button beside a read-only Yoast SEO field on the term editing screen; it unlocks the field for typing. Verb, imperative. The explanation above quotes it, so translate the two the same way.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Terms/Meta/AdminScreenHooks.php:151
msgid "Edit anyway"
msgstr "Edytuj mimo to"

#. translators: Explanation shown on a Yoast SEO field on the term editing screen once the user has typed over WPML's translation; "it" is the field's text.
#: classes/YoastSEO/Terms/Meta/AdminScreenHooks.php:152
msgid "Your text overrides the WPML translation. Leave the field empty to let WPML translate it."
msgstr "Twój tekst nadpisuje tłumaczenie WPML. Pozostaw to pole puste, aby pozwolić WPML je przetłumaczyć."

#: classes/YoastSEO/Terms/Meta/DashboardHooks.php:30
msgid "This section has the Yoast SEO texts of your categories, tags and other taxonomy terms."
msgstr "Ta sekcja zawiera teksty Yoast SEO dla Twoich kategorii, tagów i innych elementów taksonomii."
